{"name":"Alaghon","status":"ok","title":"Alaghôn","pageId":4405,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Alaghôn</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aliases\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Jewel of Turmish<br>Throne of Turmish<sup id=\"cite_ref-Alaghon_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Alaghon-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">City</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Turmish\" title=\"Turmish\">Turmish</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Metropolis</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Elf\" title=\"Elf\">Elf</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"established\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Established</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/-37_DR\" title=\"-37 DR\">−37&#160;DR</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-SoFS-p5_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SoFS-p5-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">75,000<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p184_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p184-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Alagh%C3%B4n\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Alaghôn\">Inhabitants of  Alaghôn</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Alagh%C3%B4n\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Locations in Alaghôn\">Locations in  Alaghôn</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Organizations_in_Alagh%C3%B4n\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Alaghôn\">Organizations in  Alaghôn</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Alaghôn&DPL_cat2=Settlements&action=purge\">Settlements  in  Alaghôn</a></span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Alaghôn&DPL_cat2=Roads&action=purge\">Roads  in  Alaghôn</a></span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Alaghôn&DPL_cat2=Mountains&action=purge\">Mountains  in  Alaghôn</a></span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Alaghôn&DPL_cat2=Bodies_of_water&action=purge\">Bodies of water  in  Alaghôn</a></span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Alaghôn&DPL_cat2=Forests&action=purge\">Forests  in  Alaghôn</a></span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Events_in_Alagh%C3%B4n\" title=\"Category:Events in Alaghôn\">Events in  Alaghôn</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Food_and_drink_from_Alagh%C3%B4n\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Food and drink from Alaghôn\">Food and drink from  Alaghôn</a></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Alaghôn</b>, the capital of <a href=\"/wiki/Turmish\" title=\"Turmish\">Turmish</a>, was an ancient city that saw its share of trials and tribulations over the years, ranging from terrible fires to occupation by the <a href=\"/wiki/Blue_dragon\" title=\"Blue dragon\">blue dragon</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Anaglathos\" title=\"Anaglathos\">Anaglathos</a> during the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Reign of the Wyrm (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUmVpZ25fb2ZfdGhlX1d5cm0/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Reign of the Wyrm</span>. Throughout all of this, Alaghôn survived as a trade center known as the \"throne of Turmish.\"<sup id=\"cite_ref-Alaghon_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Alaghon-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Architecture\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Architecture</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Districts\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Districts</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Surprises\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Surprises</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Culture\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Culture</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Adventuring\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Adventuring</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Races\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Races</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Notable_Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Connections\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Connections</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Alagh%C3%B4n?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The ancient port city channeled nearly all the trade that Turmish had with the rest of Faerûn for centuries,<sup id=\"cite_ref-VRPG-p15_5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VRPG-p15-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It was the most popular port on the southern fringes of the Inner Sea.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VRDMR-p33_6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VRDMR-p33-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Architecture\">Architecture</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Architecture\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Alagh%C3%B4n?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Architecture\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There were numerous stonemasons involved in the creation of the stone buildings, vaults, houses, and drains that comprised Alaghôn. This construction created \"a thousand thousand\" hiding places. This fact was especially true where the works of a human stonemason covered up the older workings of a dwarven craftsman. The secret passages and cubby holes created by such overlapping workmanship were popular places for children to play. Sometimes, the children ran into monsters - never again to run through the city streets of Alaghôn. When a child went missing, adventuring companies are sent to investigate.<sup id=\"cite_ref-Alaghon_3-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Alaghon-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Districts\">Districts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Districts\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Alagh%C3%B4n?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Districts\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Alaghôn was divided up into city districts.<sup id=\"cite_ref-Alaghon_3-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Alaghon-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>  \n</p>\n<ul><li>The Military District was north of the city and includes the naval shipyards and ports reserved for their ships.</li>\n<li>To the south lay the Merchant District</li>\n<li>To the east lay the Assembly, or Government, District.</li>\n<li>Houses continued out from Alaghôn farther west.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Surprises\">Surprises</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Surprises\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Alagh%C3%B4n?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Surprises\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Sometimes, children came across long-forgotten vaults that most likely once belonged to ancient rulers of Turmish. While it was rare for a child to come out from the maze of tunnels with a gold coin hundreds of years old, it was not unheard of.  In <a href=\"/wiki/1370_DR\" title=\"1370 DR\">1370 DR</a>, a young child came stumbling from the catacombs that ran through the government sector of the city, carrying a silver coin from the time of <a href=\"/wiki/Dempster_Turmish\" title=\"Dempster Turmish\">Dempster Turmish</a>. The child feverishly related a story of walking into a huge chamber filled with gems and coins and meeting \"an old woman with glowing red eyes.\" No sooner had he spoken these words when he slipped into a deep sleep and never recovered, so the rest of his story went untold.<sup id=\"cite_ref-Alaghon_3-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Alaghon-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>  \n</p><p>During the time of <a href=\"/wiki/Anaglathos\" title=\"Anaglathos\">Anaglathos</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Blue_dragon\" title=\"Blue dragon\">blue dragon</a> allowed a <a href=\"/wiki/Lich\" title=\"Lich\">lich</a> queen from <a href=\"/wiki/Unther\" title=\"Unther\">Unther</a> to reside below the palace. When <a href=\"/wiki/Anaglathos\" title=\"Anaglathos\">Anaglathos</a> died during the revolution, the lich queen continued to live quietly below the city. She cast a spell on the child when she found him wandering around her domain, sending him back to the surface so she could see through his eyes. The spell finally consumed the lad, but the lich queen did get a glimpse of the surface world again (in which she had only passing interest).<sup id=\"cite_ref-Alaghon_3-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Alaghon-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Culture\">Culture</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Culture\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Alagh%C3%B4n?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Culture\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i><a href=\"/wiki/Hambra%27s_Horncall\" title=\"Hambra's Horncall\">Hambra's Horncall</a></i> was a popular periodical <a href=\"/wiki/Chapbook\" title=\"Chapbook\">chapbook</a> published in Alaghôn. It had a polite and neutral attitude towards theater, music, and other cultural events it advertised and reviews. The publication was used to print public announcements for the citizens, and shady organizations often published dummy announcements hiding coded messages.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SSEd2006_7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SSEd2006-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Adventuring\">Adventuring</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Adventuring\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Alagh%C3%B4n?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Adventuring\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Adventurers seeking employment to investigate lost ruins and ancient cities were normally referred to <a href=\"/wiki/Chondath\" title=\"Chondath\">Chondath</a> \"or one of those other cities within the Vilhon,\" by the harbormaster of Alaghôn.  There was a common belief in Alaghôn (and <a href=\"/wiki/Turmish\" title=\"Turmish\">Turmish</a>) that the monsters were elsewhere, which was not always the case.<sup id=\"cite_ref-Alaghon_3-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Alaghon-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> \n</p><p>Like elsewhere in Turmish, mercenary companies performed many of the jobs normally associated with a local militia.  They were hired out to perform odd scouting jobs and patrols along the more \"wild\" areas of Turmish.  Occasionally they ran into a powerful monster they could not overcome, but more often than not they chased off whatever it is they come across.<sup id=\"cite_ref-Alaghon_2_8-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Alaghon_2-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Races\">Races</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Races\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Alagh%C3%B4n?veaction=edit&section=7\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Races\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A strong elf presence existed in Alaghôn, as many of them decided, for one reason or another, not to follow their kindred on the <a href=\"/wiki/Retreat\" title=\"Retreat\">Retreat</a>.  There was not a segregated population of elves within the city, however, for they lived comfortably around humans.<sup id=\"cite_ref-Alaghon_2_8-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Alaghon_2-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Alagh%C3%B4n?veaction=edit&section=8\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The god <a href=\"/wiki/Tyr\" title=\"Tyr\">Tyr</a> burst forth from a portal near present-day Alaghôn in the <a href=\"/wiki/-247_DR\" title=\"-247 DR\">Year of the Striking Lance, −247 DR</a> in what would become known as the <a href=\"/wiki/Procession_of_Justice\" title=\"Procession of Justice\">Procession of Justice</a>. For the next nine years, Tyr and a host of two hundred archons would pacify the remnants of <a href=\"/wiki/Jhaamdath\" title=\"Jhaamdath\">Jhaamdath</a>, making the land suitable for settlement by the <a href=\"/wiki/Turami\" title=\"Turami\">Turami</a> tribes who would soon migrate to <a href=\"/wiki/Turmish\" title=\"Turmish\">Turmish</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-GHotR-p51_9-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-GHotR-p51-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Alaghôn was founded by <a href=\"/wiki/Chondath\" title=\"Chondath\">Chondathan</a> settlers as a trading port in <a href=\"/wiki/-37_DR\" title=\"-37 DR\">−37&#160;DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p184_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p184-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It was the first recorded settlement of what would later be known as the nation of <a href=\"/wiki/Turmish\" title=\"Turmish\">Turmish</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-GHotR-p59_10-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-GHotR-p59-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Initially Alaghôn was simply a stopping point for ships moving along the inner sea, it grew into a major port that trafficked in goods coming from the dwarves of the <a href=\"/wiki/Orsraun_Mountains\" title=\"Orsraun Mountains\">Orsraun Mountains</a> and the nomadic tribes of the <a href=\"/wiki/Shining_Plains\" title=\"Shining Plains\">Shining Plains</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VRPG-p4_11-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VRPG-p4-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>In the <a href=\"/wiki/352_DR\" title=\"352 DR\">Year of the Dancing Piper, 352 DR</a> a great fire destroyed much of the city, causing considerable damage to the shipyards and granaries, crippling its naval capabilities and causing widespread famine.<sup id=\"cite_ref-GHotR-p71_12-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-GHotR-p71-12\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>12<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-VRPG-p11_13-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VRPG-p11-13\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>13<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> The ruling families argued amongst themselves about who should pay for the damages, and for ten years pirates ravaged the coast of <a href=\"/wiki/Turmish\" title=\"Turmish\">Turmish</a> and flourished across the Inner sea.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VRDMR-p8_14-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VRDMR-p8-14\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>14<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-VRPG-p11_13-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VRPG-p11-13\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>13<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Inhabitants\">Notable Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Alagh%C3%B4n?veaction=edit&section=9\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ilbrelm_Nasker\" title=\"Ilbrelm Nasker\">Ilbrelm Nasker</a>, a shoemaker who hired the poor, orphans, outcasts, and disabled and deformed people in need from around Turmish in the late 14<sup>th</sup> century <a href=\"/wiki/DR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-RL-MH8_15-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-RL-MH8-15\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>15<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Alagh%C3%B4n?veaction=edit&section=10\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Gallery\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Alagh%C3%B4n?veaction=edit&section=11\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Gallery\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"bea60b33b14d620d1d0404477672fa19\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><i>Map of Alaghôn </i>circa<i> <a href=\"/wiki/1370_DR\" title=\"1370 DR\">1370 DR</a>.</i></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><i>A partial map of Alaghôn.</i></div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Alagh%C3%B4n?veaction=edit&section=12\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap mw-references-columns\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-SoFS-p5-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-SoFS-p5_1-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href