an\">Kim Mohan</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Penny_Williams\" title=\"Penny Williams\">Penny Williams</a>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 71. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4731-7\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4731-7\">978-0-7869-4731-7</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-VRPG-p11-13\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-VRPG-p11_13-0\">13.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-VRPG-p11_13-1\">13.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jim_Butler\" title=\"Jim Butler\">Jim Butler</a>&#160;(1996). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Vilhon_Reach_(sourcebook)\" title=\"The Vilhon Reach (sourcebook)\">The Vilhon Reach</a> (Player's Guide)</i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>), p. 11. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-0400-3\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-0400-3\">0-7869-0400-3</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-VRDMR-p8-14\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-VRDMR-p8_14-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jim_Butler\" title=\"Jim Butler\">Jim Butler</a>&#160;(1996). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Vilhon_Reach_(sourcebook)\" title=\"The Vilhon Reach (sourcebook)\">The Vilhon Reach</a> (Dungeon Master's Guide)</i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>), p. 8. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-0400-3\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-0400-3\">0-7869-0400-3</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-RL-MH8-15\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-RL-MH8_15-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a> (2005-05-25). <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20080519021543/http://www.wizards.com/defaul